                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "All I can say is it’s definitely worth your money!\n\nWhat we ordered:\n1.\tGrilled Lobster\nJuicy, fresh, and surprisingly big portion.\n2.\tSteak\nNo photo could do it justice. The meat was soft, a little chewy but flavorful and well seasoned.\nBoth meals came with a carrot soup, though it tasted more like pumpkin — either way, really good and filling!\n3.\tWagyu Burger\nPortion was huge. All I can say is the juices were dripping with every bite. Pure comfort food and honestly food for the soul.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
